        <mxCell id="n25" value="Every Api method is async and returns a&#10;Future. Screens await it and show a loading&#10;state, so the window never freezes (N2).&#10;&#10;Rent charge = 10% of the price, in cents.&#10;Rent due date = order date + 7 days.&#10;&lt;&lt;bookstore-ui&gt;&gt;: shared with the manager&#10;app, in clients/bookstore-ui." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1790" y="540" width="270" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
